### Code Implementation
The Analytics component is properly configured in `web/app/layout.tsx`:

```typescript
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";

export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body className="antialiased">
        {children}
        <Analytics />
        <SpeedInsights />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

This follows the official Vercel documentation exactly:
- ✅ Analytics component imported from `@vercel/analytics/next`
- ✅ Placed inside the `<body>` tag of the root layout
- ✅ Positioned correctly alongside SpeedInsights

